{"id":1494707,"title":"Mock GoGo (IV/MTS)","summary":"Immersive Vehicles Add-On Pack of Speed Racer/Mach GoGo vehicles!","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith the help of the folks over in Immsersive Vehicles (IV/MTS), I have made this vehicle pack to allow for the crafting and use of The \"Mock 5\" rally car. This vehicle is heavily inspired from Speed Racer/Mach GoGo. I plan to add more vehicles soon, but for now I wanted to release the staple car for play.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3750a297-382b-450c-bf1c-11bcc0d58e3e.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e-Speed Racer skin from NovaWRLD-\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCredits\u0026nbsp; to Don Bruce, Limit, Wolfvanox, Cactus, Fsendventd, and Mr Mulle for making mts/IV.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI also want to thank Natsume Natsuka, Xeno, Laura, Mr Mulle, and Oskiinus for helping me despite my constant questions. You helped a newbie learn some cool stuff and I could not have done it without you. If you ever see this: thank you!\u003c/p\u003e","game":"minecraft","type":"Mods","urls":{"curseforge":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mock-gogo","project":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mock-gogo"},"thumbnail":"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1728/528/256/256/639099875347550732.jpg","created_at":"2026-03-25T10:09:44.807Z","downloads":{"monthly":0,"total":1188},"license":"","donate":"","categories":["Player Transport","Addons","Technology"],"members":[{"title":"Owner","username":"SpeedyDragon9k","id":104754544}],"links":[],"files":[{"id":8395919,"url":"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mock-gogo/files/8395919","display":"MockGoGo Pack-1.12.2_1.0.2.jar","name":"MockGoGo Pack-1.12.2_1.0.2.jar","type":"release","version":"1.12.1","filesize":938564,"versions":["Client","1.12.1","1.12","Forge","NeoForge","Server","1.